My office gets overrun by geckos (fnording tropics), so I'm well aware
of a special ability that is missing from nethack.

Geckos can hide on the ceiling.

Just use the normal hiding routines and when your character walks into
a gecko lose the move and have the gecko appear.

This may seem rather pointless, but it could really annoy a low level
character who's trying to run away down what looks to be a clear path.

